166: |---|---|---|---|
167: | 3 guided rounds | Demonstrated delivery and role reversal | Build a relation, then reveal a mismatch | Observe a misunderstanding and repair it |
168: | 9 practice rounds | Quantity, referent, destination; three each | Spatial relations, negation, conjunction; three each | Referents, requests, clarification; three each |
169: | 6 transfer rounds | Two new object sets and changed roles | New layouts and report/model direction | Same expression in changed circumstances |
