177: ## 5. Art direction and gpt-image-2 image briefs
178: 
179: **Direction: an adult paper theatre.** Warm ivory paper, charcoal outlines, muted cobalt, terracotta, and sage; crisp silhouettes, restrained print texture, subtle dimensionality. Friendly and curious, without school worksheets, philosopher caricatures, or infantilizing reward graphics. Characters look like adult collaborators. Humour comes from their situations.
